   * Function<Integer, Double> sqrt = (Integer in) -> Math.sqrt(in);
   * Map<String, Double> transformed = Maps.transformValues(map, sqrt);
   * System.out.println(transformed);
   * }
   *
   * ... prints {@code {a=2.0, b=3.0}}.
